---
title: Checkout and order coordination
---
sequenceDiagram
	actor Customer
	participant Storefront
	participant Ordering as Order API
	participant Basket as Basket API
	participant Catalog as Catalog API
	participant OrderDB as Order database
	participant Finance as Finance DTS orchestrator
	participant Kafka
	participant Notification

	Customer ->> Storefront: Submit checkout
	Storefront ->> Ordering: Create Order
	Ordering ->> Basket: Read persisted basket
	Basket -->> Ordering: Basket quantities
	Ordering ->> Catalog: Resolve current book facts and prices
	Catalog -->> Ordering: Product details and prices
	Ordering ->> OrderDB: Save New Order and item-price snapshot

	par Customer response
		Ordering -->> Storefront: 201 Created with Order ID
		Storefront -->> Customer: Show checkout confirmation
	and Asynchronous coordination
		Ordering -->> Finance: UserCheckedOutIntegrationEvent (KafkaTrigger)
		Finance ->> Finance: Start OrderOrchestrator in Durable Task Scheduler
		Finance ->> Kafka: Publish PlaceOrderCommand (activity)

		par Basket cleanup
			Kafka ->> Basket: PlaceOrderCommand
			Basket ->> Basket: Delete submitted basket

			alt Deletion succeeds
				Basket -->> Finance: BasketDeletedCompleteIntegrationEvent
				Finance ->> Kafka: DeleteBasketCompleteCommand
				Kafka ->> Ordering: Report cleanup success
			else Deletion fails
				Basket -->> Finance: BasketDeletedFailedIntegrationEvent
				Finance ->> Kafka: DeleteBasketFailedCommand
				Kafka ->> Ordering: Report cleanup failure
				Ordering ->> OrderDB: Soft-delete Order if present
				Note over Ordering: No status transition or cancellation event
			end
		and Notification consumer
			Kafka ->> Notification: PlaceOrderCommand
			Notification ->> Notification: Process placement email request
		and Timeout policy
			loop Timeout without an outcome at most two reissues after the initial command
				Finance ->> Finance: Wait 30 minutes via DTS timer and retry if active
				Finance ->> Kafka: Reissue PlaceOrderCommand
			end

			opt Retry limit exhausted
				Finance ->> Finance: Cancel and finalize orchestration
				Note over Finance,Ordering: Orchestration cancellation does not cancel the Order
			end
		end
	end
